    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25596" root="ضحك" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحْكَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single act of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحِك</span> [or <i>laughing;</i> i. e.
<i>a laugh</i>]. (S, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  [The pl.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحْكَاتٌ</span> signifies
(tropical:)  The <i>best</i> of everything: and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحْكَاتُ القُلُوبِ</span>,
<i>the best</i> of possessions, or wealth, and of children:
so says Aboo-Sa'eed. (TA.)

